      "content": "These are good, really professional. I like the contrast. \n\nOne thing though—when we're talking about the Heights property, our clients in that bracket are sometimes a bit hesitant about the \"energy\" of the neighborhood. They want to know it's a \"step up\" from the street level. \n\nCould you try another version for the Heights one? Maybe something that emphasizes the exclusivity of the building itself, so it feels more like a prestigious destination rather than just being part of the \"busy\" street scene? I want to make sure it sounds sophisticated and high-class, rather than just \"vibrant.\"",
